  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Logistics support to the humanitarian community to respond to the Cholera outbreak</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This WFP project provides logistics support to the humanitarian community to respond to the Cholera outbreak. The resources from CERF augments and accelerates humanitarian logistics services including transportation and handling of life-saving supplies, deployment of Mobile Storage Units, and cargo storage in the six most-affected districts of Blantyre, Balaka, Mangochi, Salima, Lilongwe, and Machinga.</narrative>
  </description>
